1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,519
Aaj mere paas

2
00:00:00,569 --> 00:00:01,242
game engine hai,

3
00:00:01,292 --> 00:00:02,473
3D artists hain,

4
00:00:02,523 --> 00:00:03,631
mahino ka kaam hai…

5
00:00:03,916 --> 00:00:05,059
tumhare paas kya hai?

6
00:00:05,224 --> 00:00:07,157
Mere paas… ek prompt hai!

7
00:00:07,326 --> 00:00:08,118
Aur us prompt ki duniya

8
00:00:08,168 --> 00:00:09,409
mein tum chal sakte ho!

9
00:00:09,635 --> 00:00:10,885
Ye hai Google DeepMind

10
00:00:10,935 --> 00:00:12,139
ka Genie 4,

11
00:00:12,189 --> 00:00:13,808
October 27 ko announce hua:

12
00:00:13,919 --> 00:00:15,642
real-time interactive world model.

13
00:00:15,812 --> 00:00:17,039
Keyboard se explore karo,

14
00:00:17,089 --> 00:00:18,165
aur prompt se weather,

15
00:00:18,215 --> 00:00:20,136
camera aur naye characters badlo.

16
00:00:20,444 --> 00:00:22,309
Bust giraao… tarbooz phat gaya!

17
00:00:22,359 --> 00:00:23,390
Collisions jaisi physics bhi

18
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:24,548
simulate hoti hai.

19
00:00:24,856 --> 00:00:26,466
Aur twist: environment ke sounds,

20
00:00:26,516 --> 00:00:27,710
music aur dialogue bhi AI

21
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:29,691
saath-saath generate karta hai.

22
00:00:31,474 --> 00:00:32,237
Google ke demos mein

23
00:00:32,287 --> 00:00:33,204
Gemini director ki tarah

24
00:00:33,254 --> 00:00:34,384
planning karta hai,

25
00:00:34,434 --> 00:00:35,353
taaki multi-step events

26
00:00:35,403 --> 00:00:36,529
follow ho sakein.

27
00:00:36,968 --> 00:00:38,567
Lekin physics perfect nahi,

28
00:00:38,617 --> 00:00:39,206
long scenes drift

29
00:00:39,256 --> 00:00:40,134
kar sakte hain,

30
00:00:40,184 --> 00:00:41,312
aur objects bhi inconsistent

31
00:00:41,362 --> 00:00:42,372
ho sakte hain.

32
00:00:42,724 --> 00:00:43,638
Sabse zaroori:

33
00:00:43,688 --> 00:00:44,754
abhi ye sirf trusted testers

34
00:00:44,804 --> 00:00:46,166
ka research preview hai.

35
00:00:46,451 --> 00:00:47,745
Public app launch nahi.

36
00:00:48,018 --> 00:00:48,699
Game development ka

37
00:00:48,749 --> 00:00:49,733
future exciting hai,

38
00:00:49,783 --> 00:00:50,821
lekin abhi demo ko finished

39
00:00:50,871 --> 00:00:52,203
game engine mat samjho.

40
00:00:52,476 --> 00:00:53,079
Picture abhi baaki

41
00:00:53,129 --> 00:00:54,177
hai, mere dost!

42
00:00:54,415 --> 00:00:55,177
Comment WORLD,

43
00:00:55,227 --> 00:00:56,047
official demos ka link

44
00:00:56,097 --> 00:00:57,253
main share karunga.

45
00:00:57,782 --> 00:00:58,785
Aur save karo!
